post.description:
Accept a list of items each with a prompt and tts_text.

Body (JSON):
{
    "items": [
        {"prompt": "...", "tts_text": "..."},
        {"prompt": "...", "tts_text": "..."}
    ],
    "temperature": 0.8,
    "tts_temperature": 0.7,
    "duration": 10
}

Start a simulated inference task in the background and return the task_id.

Connect to ``/ws/progress/{task_id}`` to receive real-time progress updates.

Body::
    {
        "duration": 10.0,
        "tick_interval": 1.0
    }

Returns::
    {
        "task_id": "abc123",
        "status": "started",
        "websocket": "/ws/progress/abc123"
    }

